  "prefLabel": "Bea 303.03 Printed Materials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 303.03 Printed Materials. In addition to the project requirements in Bea 303.02 above, applications for the printing of materials shall:\n\n(a) Include a detailed distribution plan for the total number of materials printed as part of the project;\n\n(b) Include 3 competitive bids for printing services; and\n\n(c) Include a conceptual layout or sample design.\n\nSource. #13270, eff 9-30-21; ss by #14624, eff 7-7-26, EXPIRES: 7-7-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bea300.html"
